  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Iodine is liberated from potassium iodide.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>Potassium</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dichromate</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>KI</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>KI</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3df